    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lyīmbo lya basolwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho naalola hangī nūmona ū Ng'wana wa Ng'holo wīmīīlaga ha lūgūlū lo Sayuni; hamò na banhū shihūmbī igana na makūmi ane na shine (144,000) abo baalī bandīkilwe a ha būshū wabo ī lina lyakwe nī lina lya ng'wa Ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niigwa n'ilaka kūfuma ng'wigūlū, gītī lya ng'huutumo gwa minzī mingī, na gītī lya ng'hilimo ntaale gwa mbula. Ī lilaka īlo nakaliigwa lyenīlo lyalī gītī lya batūji ba ndono bakūtūlaga ndono jabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bīmbaga lyīmbo ipya ū kū būtongi wī Isumbi lya būtemi, nī Shiseeng'wa shipanga ī shine, na a Banamhala. Atīho nūūlū ūmò ūyo adūgije kūlīmana ī lyīmbo lyenīlo, ūlū ītī abo shihūmbī igana na makūmi ane na shine (144,000) dūhū, abo bagūlilwe kūfuma mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A benaba hū bene abo batisosohagije na bakīma, nguno balī beela; hama hū bene abo bakanondeelaga ū Ng'wana wa Ng'holo būlī kwene ūko alīja. Hū bene abo bagūlilwe kūfuma mu banhū gīkī babize matwajo ga kwandya kūlī Mulungu na kūlī Ng'wana wa Ng'holo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balī banhū abo būtilongile būlomolomo nūūlū hado ū mu milomo yabo; nguno batī na shilingo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bamalaika badatū na būlomeeji wabo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nūmona malaika ūngī alīlala kwigūlya mu malunde; walī na Ng'hūlū Jawiza ja welelo bose kūlwa kūbalomeela pye a bikaji ba mu sī; banhū ba mahanga gose, na ng'anda jose, na ndīmi jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walomeelaga alīhaya gīkī, “Ng'ogohagi Mulungu, na nkūjagi we; nguno ī likanza lya būlamuji bokwe lyashikaga. Namyagi we ūyo alī meeja w'igūlū na sī na manyanza, pyī nī nzwīlo ja minzī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na malaika ūngī wa kabīlī ūkūūbīja; wiza alīhaya gīkī, “Yagwaga, yagwaga ī Babeli ī nhaale, īyo yalī yang'wisha mahanga gose mvinya ya būjingi wayo bo kūpelanya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na malaika ūngī hangī, wa kadatū; ūbakūūbīja, wiza alīhaya n'ilaka itaale gīkī, “Būlī ng'wene ūyo alayīlamye ī shiinū nī shiikolile shayo; nū lūmeng'ho lwayo ūzunya kūtūūlīlwa ha būshū nūūlū ha nkono gokwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nang'hwe akwīng'wa ī mvinya ya būpelanu bo ng'wa Mulungu, īyo ītatūjiwe minzī nūūlū hado; īyo īswīzilwe hūna yūtūūlwa mu shikombe sha būpelanu bo ng'wa Mulungu! Akūluhiwa mu moto gwa būgota bo shibiliti, kū būtongi bo bamalaika beela na Ng'wana wa Ng'holo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bakwīlamyaga ī shiinū nī shiikolile shayo, pyī nū wa kwanukūla lūmeng'ho lwayo, batī na kwifuula na hado yaya līīmi na būjikū; ī lyochi lyabo līkwinunga ng'wigūlya welelo bose! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu mhayo gwenūyū būlīgongwa wiyūmīlīja ū kū beela abo bashidimile ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa Mulungu, na kwīmīīla ha kūzunya kwa ng'wa Yesu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna niigwa ilaka kūfuma ng'wigūlū līlīhaya, “Andīkaga gīkī, ‘Balī na lubango a bafu abo balīchīla mulī Seeba kwīngīīla haha: Alichene, alīhaya Moyo; gīkī bifuule ū mu milīmo yabo ī ya makoye, nguno ī shītwa shabo shikūbiza hamò nabo!’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūgeswa kwa sī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nataalī nalolile gīko kwimanīla nabona ilunde lyape; a h'ilunde lyenīlo walī wigasha ho wa kūbiza gītī Ng'wana wa Munhū. Ū kū ntwe walī na ngikili ya zahabu, ū mu nkono gwakwe walī n'igeselo lyūgī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiza na malaika ūngī alīfuma mu hekalu, ūng'hamukīla n'ilaka itaale ūyo walī wigasha h'ilunde; ūng'wīla gīkī, “Lītūmage ī ligeselo lyako lyandye kūgesa, nguno lyashikaga ī likanza lya kūgesa, gaashikile a magesa ga mu sī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana ūyo walī wigasha h'ilunde ūlīponeja mu sī ī ligeselo lyakwe, yandya kūgeswa ī sī! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na malaika ūngī hangī ūfuma ū mu hekalu ya ng'wigūlū, nang'hwe walī n'igeselo lyūgī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama na malaika ūngī hangī, ū ng'wene ūfuma ha ng'walīlo, walī na būdūla higūlya ya moto, ūng'hamukīla n'ilaka itaale ūyo walī n'igeselo lyūgī; ūhaya gīkī, “Lītūmage ī ligeselo ī lyūgī wīkuminge ī mikūngo ya nzabibu gwa mu sī, nguno yapile ī mizabibu yago.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana ū malaika ng'wenūyo ūlīponeja mu sī ī ligeselo lyakwe, wīkuminga ī mizabibu, wīponeja ng'wikamīlo itaale lya mvinya ya būpelanu bo ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mizabibu yūpandagīlwa ng'wikamīlo lya mvinya, hanze ya nzengo. Gūfuma ū ng'wikamīlo lya mvinya lyenīlo mininga mingī ga kūshisha falasa ha lijamu, gūhūūma ng'hūūmo gwa kūshika bū kūle bo mailo gītī magana abīlī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
